# Control API hosts (PROTOCOL.md §Hosts and failover; daemon/internal/account/login_service.go:26-31).
# tcpdump resolves these names once, at filter-compile time. A DNS lookup is not
# a vendor request; the capture itself starts before the daemon dials.
# The fourth host is login.mbclubsh.com; login.mmegg.com:4443 is covered by the
# host set plus port 4443.
(tcp port 443 or tcp port 4443) and (host login.ajs-app.com or host login.mmegg.com or host login.mbclubsh.com)
